    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>scan-statistic-nearest · 2×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 512 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-spatial-scan-statistic-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-spatial-scan-statistic-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const neighborsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; neighbors: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const distancesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; distances: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const sortKeysOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; sortKeys: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const sortZonesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; sortZones: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">struct QueryBox { minimum: vec2f, maximum: vec2f, }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">fn getSeparationKey(position: vec2f, query: vec2f) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">  let delta = position - query;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">  return dot(delta, delta);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">fn getRadiusKey(radius: f32) -&gt; f32 { return radius * radius; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">fn getSeparationMeters(key: f32) -&gt; f32 { return sqrt(key); }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">fn getSquaredMeters(key: f32) -&gt; f32 { return key; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">fn getPairMeters(a: vec2f, b: vec2f) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  let separation = b - a;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  return sqrt(dot(separation, separation));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">fn isExactHit(key: f32, position: vec2f, query: vec2f) -&gt; bool { return key == 0.0; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">fn getQueryBox(center: vec2f, radius: f32) -&gt; QueryBox {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  return QueryBox(center - vec2f(radius), center + vec2f(radius));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">const ZONES: u32 = 437u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">const LIST: u32 = 437u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">const RADIX_BINS: u32 = 256u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">// Separation keys are non-negative f32, so their bits order as u32 keys.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">fn getZoneSeparationKey(zone: u32, centerX: f32, centerY: f32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  let zoneX = positions[positionsOffset + zone * 2u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  let zoneY = positions[positionsOffset + zone * 2u + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  return bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(getSeparationKey(vec2f(zoneX, zoneY), vec2f(centerX, centerY)));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"42\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"43\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  _ = &amp;neighbors;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  _ = &amp;distances;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  _ = &amp;sortKeys;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  _ = &amp;sortZones;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  var histogram: array&lt;u32, RADIX_BINS&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  let centerX = positions[positionsOffset + index * 2u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  let centerY = positions[positionsOffset + index * 2u + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  let row = index * LIST;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  var threshold = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  var equalCount = LIST;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  if (LIST &lt; ZONES) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">    var prefix = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">    var prefixMask = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">    var rank = LIST - 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">    for (var level = 0u; level &lt; 4u; level++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">      let shift = 24u - 8u * level;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">      for (var bin = 0u; bin &lt; RADIX_BINS; bin++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">        histogram[bin] = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">      for (var zone = 0u; zone &lt; ZONES; zone++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">        let key = getZoneSeparationKey(zone, centerX, centerY);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">        if ((key &amp; prefixMask) == prefix) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">          let bin = (key &gt;&gt; shift) &amp; 255u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">          histogram[bin] = histogram[bin] + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">      var digit = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">      loop {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">        if (digit == RADIX_BINS - 1u || rank &lt; histogram[digit]) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">          break;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">        rank -= histogram[digit];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">        digit++;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">      prefix = prefix | (digit &lt;&lt; shift);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">      prefixMask = prefixMask | (255u &lt;&lt; shift);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">    threshold = prefix;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">    equalCount = rank + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">  var filled = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">  var equalTaken = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">  for (var zone = 0u; zone &lt; ZONES; zone++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">    if (filled &gt;= LIST) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">      break;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">    let key = getZoneSeparationKey(zone, centerX, centerY);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">    var take = key &lt; threshold;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">    if (!take &amp;&amp; key == threshold &amp;&amp; equalTaken &lt; equalCount) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">      take = true;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">      equalTaken++;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">    if (take) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">      distances[distancesOffset + row + filled] = key;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">      neighbors[neighborsOffset + row + filled] = zone;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">      filled++;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">  for (var shift = 0u; shift &lt; 32u; shift += 16u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">    // Digit shift: the table rows to the sort scratch.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">    for (var bin = 0u; bin &lt; RADIX_BINS; bin++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">      histogram[bin] = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">    for (var slot = 0u; slot &lt; LIST; slot++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">      let bin = (distances[distancesOffset + row + slot] &gt;&gt; shift) &amp; 255u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">      histogram[bin] = histogram[bin] + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">    var running = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">    for (var bin = 0u; bin &lt; RADIX_BINS; bin++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">      let count = histogram[bin];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">      histogram[bin] = running;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">      running += count;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">    for (var slot = 0u; slot &lt; LIST; slot++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">      let key = distances[distancesOffset + row + slot];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">      let bin = (key &gt;&gt; shift) &amp; 255u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">      let destination = histogram[bin];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">      histogram[bin] = destination + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">      sortKeys[sortKeysOffset + row + destination] = key;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">      sortZones[sortZonesOffset + row + destination] = neighbors[neighborsOffset + row + slot];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">    // Digit shift + 8: the sort scratch back to the table rows.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">    let nextShift = shift + 8u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">    for (var bin = 0u; bin &lt; RADIX_BINS; bin++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">      histogram[bin] = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"142\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"143\">    for (var slot = 0u; slot &lt; LIST; slot++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">      let bin = (sortKeys[sortKeysOffset + row + slot] &gt;&gt; nextShift) &amp; 255u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">      histogram[bin] = histogram[bin] + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"146\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"147\">    running = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"148\">    for (var bin = 0u; bin &lt; RADIX_BINS; bin++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"149\">      let count = histogram[bin];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"150\">      histogram[bin] = running;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"151\">      running += count;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"152\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"153\">    for (var slot = 0u; slot &lt; LIST; slot++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"154\">      let key = sortKeys[sortKeysOffset + row + slot];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"155\">      let bin = (key &gt;&gt; nextShift) &amp; 255u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"156\">      let destination = histogram[bin];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"157\">      histogram[bin] = destination + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"158\">      distances[distancesOffset + row + destination] = key;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"159\">      neighbors[neighborsOffset + row + destination] = sortZones[sortZonesOffset + row + slot];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"160\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"161\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"162\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\